lines=['# EVALUATOR ONLY - Historical GitHub screening','','Do not place this directory, fixing commits/PRs, timelines, patches, grading notes, or report in any repair actor workspace/context. The raw original issue body is separate and exact UTF-8 (SHA256 recorded). A later worker packet should contain only permitted original requirements and the pre-fix source tree, with solution history unavailable.','','Checked: '+out['checked_at']+'. Sixteen resolved issues across five unarchived repositories were screened through live GitHub API; raw issue, comments/timeline, fix commit and parent, package metadata, tree and native source/test evidence are retained. **No benchmark model calls, implementations, installs, builds, tests, or harness edits were performed.**','','## Recommendation','','First pilot: [node-fetch #1386](https://github.com/node-fetch/node-fetch/issues/1386). Original requirements are a concrete malformed-Location redirect crash and catchable error; original body has no solution patch. Pre-fix `2d5399ed5605fb1b2e887f6e7953bc02e6194d52`, merged [PR1387](https://github.com/node-fetch/node-fetch/pull/1387), fix `6e4c1e4f67b7b6b8de13bbbf88991894dc003245`. PR1395 is **unmerged** and must not be used as the fix oracle. Runtime source is ESM JS in src/ and native Mocha tests import it directly. This is a medium integration task despite a small source patch.','','Second provisional pilot: [node-fetch #1446](https://github.com/node-fetch/node-fetch/issues/1446), keepalive listener/memory retention. Pre-fix `004b3ac8324e6cdbfb5d04b8bbdc6664ea48fbcf`, [PR1474](https://github.com/node-fetch/node-fetch/pull/1474), fix `043a5fcfc82884155bcb2afba2a82333b2f29c02`. The issue was closed as a likely duplicate of1295 and comments identify this fix, so linkage confidence is lower. No native regression was added by the fix; verify resource/listener retention behavior deterministically before committing scored model spend. Avoid memory slope alone. #1574 is a smaller reserve whose nondeterministic reproduction also needs proving.','','## Native test and host feasibility','','node-fetch declares `^12.20.0 || ^14.13.1 || >=16.0.0`, so Node24 satisfies the metadata. The source is direct ESM and has three pure JS production dependency ranges (data-uri-to-buffer, fetch-blob, formdata-polyfill), no build step. Native test script is `mocha` (Mocha9), using chai and local test/utils/server.js. TestServer uses listen(0); test/main.js reads test/utils/dummy.txt. The inspected test/main.js and server.js contain no child_process/spawn/exec. An evaluator-owned visible.test.mjs could potentially instantiate Mocha in-process and load its unchanged native files using Mocha programmatic API, while hidden grading remains external. This is a feasibility observation, not a verified runner or permission proof. Full native tests on this host were not run. No lockfile is present in the fetched tree, so dependency closure must be frozen separately before scoring. Node24 historical stream behavior may require a baseline-failure policy; do not silently change original tests.','','Only node-fetch has relevant runtime source under literal src/. p-queue uses source/, emittery and p-limit root index.js, nanostores atom/, computed/, listen-keys/. Those are hard frozen-adapter exclusions; do not relocate or copy their code under src, shim their implementation, or rephrase the original issue into an artificial replacement task. Their inclusion provides a diverse task-quality shortlist for later tooling decisions, not permission to change the architecture. AVA and build/lint tooling also use orchestration outside the current in-process test route.','','Repository activity at check: node-fetch last pushed2026-05-12 (about five months ago, modest activity); p-queue2026-10-12; emittery2026-09-26; nanostores2026-10-14; p-limit2026-09-18. All report archived=false. A last push is weaker than sustained maintenance; node-fetch is a compatibility exception to a strict recent-activity filter.','','Seven tasks form a quality shortlist (2provisional pilots,1reserve and4 source-layout-blocked reserves): node-fetch1386/1446/1574, p-queue251/168, emittery118, nanostores323. They are not seven runnable tasks under the frozen adapter. Many other real issues supply precise implementation code or fix links in the original body. Keep bodies unchanged and mark contamination; do not delete supplied hints to create a harder synthetic issue.','','## Sixteen candidate rows','','| Issue | Complexity | Disposition | Fix | Pre-fix |','|---|---|---|---|---|']
